t Success Gettysburg College, in historic Gettysburg, Pennsylvania, is seeking a full-time Class Advisor to join the Center for Student Success (CSS). Gettysburg College is a highly selective, residential undergraduate liberal arts college which enrolls approximately 2,200 students. This position reports to the Dean of Academic Advising and Student Success. The Class Advisor & Honor Code Coordinator ... View Details Bookmark AV Support Technician Admin/Spt Staff Office of Student Activities and Greek Life Gettysburg College is currently seeking a full-time AV Support Technician reporting directly to the Associate Director of Campus Life.The AV Support Technician position is responsible for:Installing and supporting AV equipment in enhanced classrooms and other AV-equipped campus spacesPerforming preventive and cycle maintenance of enhanced classrooms and all AV-equipped campus spacesTroubleshoot... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Pastoral Care Coordinator Casual Religious and Spiritual Life Gettysburg College invites applications for a part-time Pastoral Care Coordinator to join our Center for Religious and Spiritual Life. This is a meaningful opportunity for a compassionate and dedicated professional to support the spiritual, emotional, and personal well-being of our diverse campus community. Key responsibilities include:Providing pastoral care for students on personal, emotional... View Details Bookmark Part-Time Technical Director/Scene Shop Supervisor Casual Theatre Arts Gettysburg College is currently seeking a part-time Technical Director/Scene Shop Supervisor to work in the Theater Arts Department. This position will work a flexible schedule, including evenings and weekends, to support rehearsals, technical rehearsals, and production deadlines.The position reports directly to the Faculty Set Designer, with a dotted line to the Executive Director of Campus Sa... View Details Bookmark Student Accounts Customer Service and Collections Specialist Admin/Spt Staff 